{
  "key": 28403,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "The Colosseum upstairs is for\n",
        "link battles.\r",
        "Battle records, such as how many times\n",
        "you had link battles and the results,\f",
        "are recorded on the back of your\f",
        "Trainer Card."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00001",
      "en_US": "Oh, you are a Team Rocket member..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I wonder how many kinds of Pokémon\n",
        "there are in the world.\r",
        "A long time ago, Professor Oak said\n",
        "there were 150 different kinds...\r",
        "Since then, many new Pokémon have\n",
        "been discovered in different regions.\r",
        "There are almost 500 different kinds\n",
        "known now..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00003",
      "en_US": "Team Rocket...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "A higher level Pokémon doesn’t\n",
        "always win.\r",
        "After all, it may have a type\n",
        "disadvantage.\r",
        "I don’t think there is a single\n",
        "Pokémon that is the toughest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "I think I’ve met you before...\r",
        "You must have a reason for\n",
        "looking like that...?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0583_T25PC0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, I don’t mind restoring a Pokémon’s\n",
        "health, even when they belong to\f",
        "Team Rocket...\r",
        "But stay away from other places, OK?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
